			invisible: true
			rewards: [
				{
					auto: "invisible"
					command: "tellraw @a [\"\",{\"text\":\"Welcome to hell...\",\"color\":\"dark_red\",\"italic\":true,\"bold\":true},\" Its \",{\"text\":\"hot\",\"underlined\":true,\"color\":\"gold\"},\" here, so be \",{\"text\":\"fast\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"italic\":true},\", and really... really avoid \",{\"text\":\"lava\",\"color\":\"red\",\"bold\":true,\"underlined\":true}]"
					id: "186FDFAA0E70E721"
					silent: true
					type: "command"
				}
				{
					id: "7A753511C214D9B7"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "The Stranger"
							display: { }
							generation: 3
							pages: [
								"{\"extra\":[{\"bold\":true,\"text\":\"Journal Entry: The Abyss Below\"},{\"text\":\"\\n\"},{\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"blue\",\"text\":\"The Portal of Hope? Or Doom?\"},{\"text\":\"\\nI swore to myself I wouldn’t come down here. The air itself feels wrong—thick, heavy, like it’s watching me.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Something is deeply cursed in this place, though I can’t put my finger on it. The shadows twist in ways they shouldn’t, and there’s a faint sound... like a heartbeat, but it isn’t mine.\\n \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"And yet, here I am. Desperation has a funny way of overriding fear. If you’re reading this, then either you’ve followed my footsteps or fate has driven you down here, too.\\n \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"The truth is, this world above—the endless frost, the cryptids, the emptiness—it isn’t survivable for long. The frost will take you eventually, no matter how much you fight it. But I’ve found something down here, buried in this hellish abyss.\\n \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"It’s a... portal, I think. A massive, otherworldly construct, ancient and shattered. Whoever—or whatever—built it left it broken. But I believe it’s our only chance of escaping this frozen nightmare. \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"To activate it, you’ll need materials—rare, dangerous ones. Some of those can only be found here, deep in this cursed cavern.\\nThere are whispers that something down here might also help you survive a bit longer in the frost, though I’ve yet to find it. \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Maybe it’s just hope playing tricks on me. Maybe it’s real. Either way, you’ll need to explore, scavenge, and risk everything. But be warned: whatever is wrong with this place doesn’t want you here.\\n \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"I’ve had nightmares—visions of something waiting, lurking, biding its time. A shadow that feels alive, watching me from just beyond the edge of sight. \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"I can’t say what it is, only that it fills me with a dread I can’t shake. If you sense it too, run. Run, and don’t look back.\\nIf you manage to collect what’s needed and get that portal working... maybe, just maybe, \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"there’s a way out of this nightmare. A new world, a better world—one that isn’t frozen solid or cursed by whatever darkness dwells here.\\nBut that’s a big “if.” Until then, tread carefully. \"}"
								"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Trust nothing in these caves. And for the love of whatever you hold dear, don’t let curiosity pull you too far into the shadows.\\nGood luck, stranger. You’ll need it.\\n\"},{\"italic\":true,\"text\":\"—The Stranger\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
							]
							resolved: 1b
							title: "一份奇怪的日记条目"
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
